{"id":"551c8bf1fc88e1ec","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-truth-induction-schema.md","title":"全真理语言归纳模式","display":"prop-truth-induction-schema — 全真理语言归纳模式","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-truth-induction-schema","aliases":["91-prop-truth-induction-schema"],"display":"prop-truth-induction-schema — 全真理语言归纳模式","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-induction]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]","[[91-df-KF]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-truth-induction-schema"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-truth-induction-schema</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-truth-induction-schema — 全真理语言归纳模式"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08a0ab6453addb52\" href=\"?note=08a0ab6453addb52\" title=\"91-df-truth-induction\">91-df-truth-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (含真理谓词的算术语言)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x,\\vec y)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x,\\vec y)\\)</span> (至多含所示自由变量的公式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (全真理语言归纳模式)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}\\)</span> (真理断言形成的归纳子模式,\nsee <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"08a0ab6453addb52\" href=\"?note=08a0ab6453addb52\" title=\"91-df-truth-induction\">91-df-truth-induction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\vec y\\,\n\\left(\n\\bigl[\n\\varphi(0,\\vec y)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\to\\varphi(Sx,\\vec y)\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\n\\right)\n\\,\\middle|\\,\n\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\vec y\\,\n\\left(\n\\bigl[\n\\varphi(0,\\vec y)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\to\\varphi(Sx,\\vec y)\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\n\\right)\n\\,\\middle|\\,\n\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因为每个\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\">\\(T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))\\)</span>\n本身都是一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 公式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是公理模式：每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 公式给出一个实例；对象语言中没有\n直接对“所有公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>”量化。标准全归纳 KF 采用这类模式，弱变体\n可能只保留算术归纳或正公式归纳。</p>\n<p>这里的集合等式采用上游定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sx\">\\(Sx\\)</span> 句法模板；算术中等价的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+1\">\\(x+1\\)</span> 实例族不应直接当作同一个原始公式集合。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1 的归纳约定；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a> 的本地模式展开。</p>\n<p>扩大公式域提供建立证明真性等内部归纳的手段，但单凭模式定义不能推出\n某个具体理论已证明全局反思、可靠性或一致性；还需要相应组合真理公理\n以及对证明编码的形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-induction","status":"resolved","id":"08a0ab6453addb52","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-induction]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-induction","status":"resolved","id":"08a0ab6453addb52","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}$ (真理断言形成的归纳子模式,\nsee [[91-df-truth-induction]])","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"来源：§5.1 的归纳约定；[[91-df-induction-schema]] 的本地模式展开。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}(x,\\vec y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}truth\\text{-}induction\\text{-}schema}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\forall\\vec y\\,\n\\left(\n\\bigl[\n\\varphi(0,\\vec y)\n\\land\n\\forall x\\,\n\\bigl(\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\to\\varphi(Sx,\\vec y)\\bigr)\n\\bigr]\n\\to\n\\forall x\\,\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\n\\right)\n\\,\\middle|\\,\n\\varphi(x,\\vec y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Ind}}^{T}\n\\subseteq\n\\mathrm{Ind}_{\\mathcal L_T},","display":true},{"tex":"T(\\operatorname{Sub}_x(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner},n))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"Sx","display":false},{"tex":"x+1","display":false}],"bytes":2063,"backlinks":[{"id":"59574fe12e6b6cd2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-induction-schema]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-truth-induction-schema]]"}],"outgoing":["08a0ab6453addb52","09791de618b277ba","a0a2284f96eaea1d"]}